          "bible_book_eng": "Haggai",
          "teaching_file_name": "310092_UKR_TTB_1160_21112017_Haggai_1_12_Haggai_2_4_MM_.mp3",
          "folder_path": "https://ttb-content-migrations-gigster.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/TAM_TTB-Tamil+BI/310092_UKR_TTB_1160_21112017_Haggai_1_12_Haggai_2_4_MM_.mp3",
          "teaching_start_point": "0112",
          "teaching_end_point": "0204"
        },
        {
          "book_name": "Haggai",
          "book_id": "Haggai",
          "book_order": "",
          "chapter_id": "2",
          "chapter_title": "Chapter 2",
          "verse_id": "2",
          "verse_text": "Скажи но до Зоровавеля, сина Шалтіїлового, намісника Юдиного, і до Ісуса, сина Єгосадакового, великого священика, та до решти народу, говорячи.",
          "paragraph_number": "2",
          "teaching_id": "18877",
          "teaching_audio": "https://ttb-transcoder-final-prod.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/8d5a73df-cbac-4739-ab10-f642a175f073",
          "teaching_name": "Аггея 1:12-2:4",
          "teachings_badge_image": "https://manage.churchbase.com/uploads/ttb_bible_badges/Haggai.jpg",
          "bible_book": "Аггея",
          "bible_book_eng": "Haggai",
          "teaching_file_name": "310092_UKR_TTB_1160_21112017_Haggai_1_12_Haggai_2_4_MM_.mp3",
          "folder_path": "https://ttb-content-migrations-gigster.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/TAM_TTB-Tamil+BI/310092_UKR_TTB_1160_21112017_Haggai_1_12_Haggai_2_4_MM_.mp3",
          "teaching_start_point": "0112",
          "teaching_end_point": "0204"
        },
        {
          "book_name": "Haggai",
          "book_id": "Haggai",
          "book_order": "",
          "chapter_id": "2",
          "chapter_title": "Chapter 2",
          "verse_id": "3",
          "verse_text": "Хто серед вас позостався, що бачив цей дім у першій його славі? А яким ви бачите його тепер? Чи ж не є він супроти того, як ніщо в ваших очах?",
          "paragraph_number": "3",
          "teaching_id": "18877",
          "teaching_audio": "https://ttb-transcoder-final-prod.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/8d5a73df-cbac-4739-ab10-f642a175f073",
          "teaching_name": "Аггея 1:12-2:4",
          "teachings_badge_image": "https://manage.churchbase.com/uploads/ttb_bible_badges/Haggai.jpg",
          "bible_book": "Аггея",
          "bible_book_eng": "Haggai",
          "teaching_file_name": "310092_UKR_TTB_1160_21112017_Haggai_1_12_Haggai_2_4_MM_.mp3",
          "folder_path": "https://ttb-content-migrations-gigster.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/TAM_TTB-Tamil+BI/310092_UKR_TTB_1160_21112017_Haggai_1_12_Haggai_2_4_MM_.mp3",
          "teaching_start_point": "0112",
          "teaching_end_point": "0204"
        },
        {
          "book_name": "Haggai",
          "book_id": "Haggai",
          "book_order": "",
          "chapter_id": "2",
          "chapter_title": "Chapter 2",
          "verse_id": "4",
          "verse_text": "А тепер будь мужній, Зоровавелю, говорить Господь, і зміцнися, Ісусе, сину Єгосадаків, священику великий, і зміцнися, ввесь народе землі, говорить Господь, і робіть, бо Я з вами, говорить Господь Саваот.",
          "paragraph_number": "4",
          "teaching_id": "18877",
          "teaching_audio": "https://ttb-transcoder-final-prod.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/8d5a73df-cbac-4739-ab10-f642a175f073",
          "teaching_name": "Аггея 1:12-2:4",
          "teachings_badge_image": "https://manage.churchbase.com/uploads/ttb_bible_badges/Haggai.jpg",
          "bible_book": "Аггея",
          "bible_book_eng": "Haggai",
          "teaching_file_name": "310092_UKR_TTB_1160_21112017_Haggai_1_12_Haggai_2_4_MM_.mp3",
          "folder_path": "https://ttb-content-migrations-gigster.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/TAM_TTB-Tamil+BI/310092_UKR_TTB_1160_21112017_Haggai_1_12_Haggai_2_4_MM_.mp3",
          "teaching_start_point": "0112",
          "teaching_end_point": "0204"
        },
        {
          "book_name": "Haggai",
          "book_id": "Haggai",
          "book_order": "",
          "chapter_id": "2",
          "chapter_title": "Chapter 2",
          "verse_id": "5",
          "verse_text": "Слова, яким Я склав з вами заповіта, коли ви виходили з Єгипту, а дух Мій пробуває серед вас, не бійтеся!",
          "paragraph_number": "5",
          "teaching_id": "18878",
          "teaching_audio": "https://ttb-transcoder-final-prod.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/b7f6584e-6080-4771-bd36-2661525d9c5a",
          "teaching_name": "Аггея 2:5-7",
          "teachings_badge_image": "https://manage.churchbase.com/uploads/ttb_bible_badges/Haggai.jpg",
          "bible_book": "Аггея",
          "bible_book_eng": "Haggai",
          "teaching_file_name": "310093_UKR_TTB_1161_22112017_Haggai_2_5_Haggai_2_7_MM_.mp3",
          "folder_path": "https://ttb-content-migrations-gigster.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/TAM_TTB-Tamil+BI/310093_UKR_TTB_1161_22112017_Haggai_2_5_Haggai_2_7_MM_.mp3",
          "teaching_start_point": "0205",
          "teaching_end_point": "0207"
        },
        {
          "book_name": "Haggai",
          "book_id": "Haggai",
          "book_order": "",
          "chapter_id": "2",
          "chapter_title": "Chapter 2",
          "verse_id": "6",
          "verse_text": "Бо так промовляє Господь Саваот: Ще раз, а станеться це незабаром, і Я затрясу небо та землю, і море та суходіл!",
          "paragraph_number": "6",
          "teaching_id": "18878",
          "teaching_audio": "https://ttb-transcoder-final-prod.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/b7f6584e-6080-4771-bd36-2661525d9c5a",
          "teaching_name": "Аггея 2:5-7",
          "teachings_badge_image": "https://manage.churchbase.com/uploads/ttb_bible_badges/Haggai.jpg",
          "bible_book": "Аггея",
          "bible_book_eng": "Haggai",
          "teaching_file_name": "310093_UKR_TTB_1161_22112017_Haggai_2_5_Haggai_2_7_MM_.mp3",
          "folder_path": "https://ttb-content-migrations-gigster.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/TAM_TTB-Tamil+BI/310093_UKR_TTB_1161_22112017_Haggai_2_5_Haggai_2_7_MM_.mp3",
          "teaching_start_point": "0205",
          "teaching_end_point": "0207"
        },
        {
          "book_name": "Haggai",
          "book_id": "Haggai",
          "book_order": "",
          "chapter_id": "2",
          "chapter_title": "Chapter 2",
          "verse_id": "7",
          "verse_text": "І затрясу всіма народами, і прийдуть коштовності всіх народів, і наповню цей дім славою, говорить Господь Саваот.",
          "paragraph_number": "7",
          "teaching_id": "18878",
          "teaching_audio": "https://ttb-transcoder-final-prod.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/b7f6584e-6080-4771-bd36-2661525d9c5a",
          "teaching_name": "Аггея 2:5-7",
          "teachings_badge_image": "https://manage.churchbase.com/uploads/ttb_bible_badges/Haggai.jpg",
          "bible_book": "Аггея",
          "bible_book_eng": "Haggai",
          "teaching_file_name": "310093_UKR_TTB_1161_22112017_Haggai_2_5_Haggai_2_7_MM_.mp3",
          "folder_path": "https://ttb-content-migrations-gigster.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/TAM_TTB-Tamil+BI/310093_UKR_TTB_1161_22112017_Haggai_2_5_Haggai_2_7_MM_.mp3",
          "teaching_start_point": "0205",
          "teaching_end_point": "0207"
        },
        {
          "book_name": "Haggai",
          "book_id": "Haggai",
          "book_order": "",
          "chapter_id": "2",
          "chapter_title": "Chapter 2",
          "verse_id": "8",
          "verse_text": "Моє срібло й Моє золото, говорить Господь Саваот.",
          "paragraph_number": "8",
          "teaching_id": "18879",
          "teaching_audio": "https://ttb-transcoder-final-prod.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/cec64830-ebbc-49d7-ae01-7c4e0f9c6ba8",
          "teaching_name": "Аггея 2:8-13",
          "teachings_badge_image": "https://manage.churchbase.com/uploads/ttb_bible_badges/Haggai.jpg",
          "bible_book": "Аггея",
          "bible_book_eng": "Haggai",
          "teaching_file_name": "310094_UKR_TTB_1162_23112017_Haggai_2_8_Haggai_2_13_MM_.mp3",
          "folder_path": "https://ttb-content-migrations-gigster.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/TAM_TTB-Tamil+BI/310094_UKR_TTB_1162_23112017_Haggai_2_8_Haggai_2_13_MM_.mp3",
          "teaching_start_point": "0208",
          "teaching_end_point": "0213"
        },
        {
          "book_name": "Haggai",
          "book_id": "Haggai",
          "book_order": "",
          "chapter_id": "2",
          "chapter_title": "Chapter 2",
          "verse_id": "9",
          "verse_text": "Більша буде слава цього останнього дому від першого, говорить Господь Саваот, і на цьому місці Я дам мир, говорить Господь Саваот.",
          "paragraph_number": "9",
          "teaching_id": "18879",
          "teaching_audio": "https://ttb-transcoder-final-prod.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/cec64830-ebbc-49d7-ae01-7c4e0f9c6ba8",
          "teaching_name": "Аггея 2:8-13",
          "teachings_badge_image": "https://manage.churchbase.com/uploads/ttb_bible_badges/Haggai.jpg",
          "bible_book": "Аггея",
          "bible_book_eng": "Haggai",
          "teaching_file_name": "310094_UKR_TTB_1162_23112017_Haggai_2_8_Haggai_2_13_MM_.mp3",
          "folder_path": "https://ttb-content-migrations-gigster.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/TAM_TTB-Tamil+BI/310094_UKR_TTB_1162_23112017_Haggai_2_8_Haggai_2_13_MM_.mp3",
          "teaching_start_point": "0208",
          "teaching_end_point": "0213"
        },
        {
          "book_name": "Haggai",
          "book_id": "Haggai",
          "book_order": "",
          "chapter_id": "2",
          "chapter_title": "Chapter 2",
          "verse_id": "10",
          "verse_text": "Двадцятого й четвертого дня, дев'ятого місяця, другого року Дарія було слово Господнє через пророка Огія таке:",
          "paragraph_number": "10",
          "teaching_id": "18879",
          "teaching_audio": "https://ttb-transcoder-final-prod.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/cec64830-ebbc-49d7-ae01-7c4e0f9c6ba8",
          "teaching_name": "Аггея 2:8-13",
          "teachings_badge_image": "https://manage.churchbase.com/uploads/ttb_bible_badges/Haggai.jpg",
          "bible_book": "Аггея",
          "bible_book_eng": "Haggai",
          "teaching_file_name": "310094_UKR_TTB_1162_23112017_Haggai_2_8_Haggai_2_13_MM_.mp3",
          "folder_path": "https://ttb-content-migrations-gigster.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/TAM_TTB-Tamil+BI/310094_UKR_TTB_1162_23112017_Haggai_2_8_Haggai_2_13_MM_.mp3",
          "teaching_start_point": "0208",
          "teaching_end_point": "0213"
        },
        {
          "book_name": "Haggai",
          "book_id": "Haggai",
          "book_order": "",
          "chapter_id": "2",
          "chapter_title": "Chapter 2",
          "verse_id": "11",
          "verse_text": "Так говорить Господь Саваот: Запитай но священиків про Закона, говорячи:",
          "paragraph_number": "11",
          "teaching_id": "18879",
          "teaching_audio": "https://ttb-transcoder-final-prod.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/cec64830-ebbc-49d7-ae01-7c4e0f9c6ba8",
          "teaching_name": "Аггея 2:8-13",
          "teachings_badge_image": "https://manage.churchbase.com/uploads/ttb_bible_badges/Haggai.jpg",
          "bible_book": "Аггея",
          "bible_book_eng": "Haggai",
          "teaching_file_name": "310094_UKR_TTB_1162_23112017_Haggai_2_8_Haggai_2_13_MM_.mp3",
          "folder_path": "https://ttb-content-migrations-gigster.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/TAM_TTB-Tamil+BI/310094_UKR_TTB_1162_23112017_Haggai_2_8_Haggai_2_13_MM_.mp3",
          "teaching_start_point": "0208",
          "teaching_end_point": "0213"
        },
        {
          "book_name": "Haggai",
          "book_id": "Haggai",
          "book_order": "",
          "chapter_id": "2",
          "chapter_title": "Chapter 2",
          "verse_id": "12",
          "verse_text": "Ось несе хтось освячене м'ясо в полі своєї одежі, і доторкнеться полою своєю до хліба, чи до потрави, чи до вина, чи до оливи, чи до якої поживи, чи стане те освяченим? І священики відповіли та й сказали: Ні!",
          "paragraph_number": "12",
          "teaching_id": "18879",
          "teaching_audio": "https://ttb-transcoder-final-prod.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/cec64830-ebbc-49d7-ae01-7c4e0f9c6ba8",
          "teaching_name": "Аггея 2:8-13",
          "teachings_badge_image": "https://manage.churchbase.com/uploads/ttb_bible_badges/Haggai.jpg",
          "bible_book": "Аггея",
          "bible_book_eng": "Haggai",
          "teaching_file_name": "310094_UKR_TTB_1162_23112017_Haggai_2_8_Haggai_2_13_MM_.mp3",
          "folder_path": "https://ttb-content-migrations-gigster.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/TAM_TTB-Tamil+BI/310094_UKR_TTB_1162_23112017_Haggai_2_8_Haggai_2_13_MM_.mp3",
          "teaching_start_point": "0208",
          "teaching_end_point": "0213"
        },
        {
          "book_name": "Haggai",
          "book_id": "Haggai",
          "book_order": "",
          "chapter_id": "2",
          "chapter_title": "Chapter 2",
          "verse_id": "13",
          "verse_text": "Тоді Огій сказав: Якщо б нечистий через мертвого доторкнувся до всього цього, чи стане воно нечистим? І відповіли священики та й сказали: Стане нечистим!",
          "paragraph_number": "13",
          "teaching_id": "18879",
          "teaching_audio": "https://ttb-transcoder-final-prod.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/cec64830-ebbc-49d7-ae01-7c4e0f9c6ba8",
          "teaching_name": "Аггея 2:8-13",
          "teachings_badge_image": "https://manage.churchbase.com/uploads/ttb_bible_badges/Haggai.jpg",
          "bible_book": "Аггея",
          "bible_book_eng": "Haggai",
          "teaching_file_name": "310094_UKR_TTB_1162_23112017_Haggai_2_8_Haggai_2_13_MM_.mp3",
          "folder_path": "https://ttb-content-migrations-gigster.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/TAM_TTB-Tamil+BI/310094_UKR_TTB_1162_23112017_Haggai_2_8_Haggai_2_13_MM_.mp3",
          "teaching_start_point": "0208",
          "teaching_end_point": "0213"
        },
        {
          "book_name": "Haggai",
          "book_id": "Haggai",
          "book_order": "",
          "chapter_id": "2",
          "chapter_title": "Chapter 2",
          "verse_id": "14",
          "verse_text": "І відповів Огій та й сказав: Отакий народ цей, і такий цей люд перед Моїм лицем, говорить Господь, і такий усякий чин їхніх рук, і що вони складають там, нечисте воно!",
          "paragraph_number": "14",
          "teaching_id": "18880",
          "teaching_audio": "https://ttb-transcoder-final-prod.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/e732782d-6a82-4074-a9b4-f108725ffd19",
          "teaching_name": "Аггея 2:14-14",
          "teachings_badge_image": "https://manage.churchbase.com/uploads/ttb_bible_badges/Haggai.jpg",
          "bible_book": "Аггея",
          "bible_book_eng": "Haggai",
          "teaching_file_name": "310096_UKR_TTB_1163_24112017_Haggai_2_14_Haggai_2_14_MM_.mp3",
          "folder_path": "https://ttb-content-migrations-gigster.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/TAM_TTB-Tamil+BI/310096_UKR_TTB_1163_24112017_Haggai_2_14_Haggai_2_14_MM_.mp3",
          "teaching_start_point": "0214",
          "teaching_end_point": "0214"
        },
        {
          "book_name": "Haggai",
          "book_id": "Haggai",
          "book_order": "",
          "chapter_id": "2",
          "chapter_title": "Chapter 2",
          "verse_id": "15",
          "verse_text": "А тепер зверніть но своє серце на час від цього дня й далі, ще поки не був покладений камінь до каменя в Господньому храмі.",
          "paragraph_number": "15",
          "teaching_id": "18881",
          "teaching_audio": "https://ttb-transcoder-final-prod.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/741bb091-2d27-475a-aed3-96bec4487b0d",
          "teaching_name": "Аггея 2:15-23",
          "teachings_badge_image": "https://manage.churchbase.com/uploads/ttb_bible_badges/Haggai.jpg",
          "bible_book": "Аггея",
          "bible_book_eng": "Haggai",
          "teaching_file_name": "310097_UKR_TTB_1164_27112017_Haggai_2_15_Haggai_2_23_MM_.mp3",
          "folder_path": "https://ttb-content-migrations-gigster.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/TAM_TTB-Tamil+BI/310097_UKR_TTB_1164_27112017_Haggai_2_15_Haggai_2_23_MM_.mp3",
          "teaching_start_point": "0215",
          "teaching_end_point": "0223"
        },
        {
          "book_name": "Haggai",
          "book_id": "Haggai",
          "book_order": "",
          "chapter_id": "2",
          "chapter_title": "Chapter 2",
          "verse_id": "16",
          "verse_text": "Відколи то було, що приходив бувало до копиці набирати двадцять мір, а було тільки десять, приходив до чавила набрати п'ятдесят мір, а було двадцять.",
          "paragraph_number": "16",
          "teaching_id": "18881",
          "teaching_audio": "https://ttb-transcoder-final-prod.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/741bb091-2d27-475a-aed3-96bec4487b0d",
          "teaching_name": "Аггея 2:15-23",
          "teachings_badge_image": "https://manage.churchbase.com/uploads/ttb_bible_badges/Haggai.jpg",
          "bible_book": "Аггея",
          "bible_book_eng": "Haggai",
          "teaching_file_name": "310097_UKR_TTB_1164_27112017_Haggai_2_15_Haggai_2_23_MM_.mp3",
          "folder_path": "https://ttb-content-migrations-gigster.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/TAM_TTB-Tamil+BI/310097_UKR_TTB_1164_27112017_Haggai_2_15_Haggai_2_23_MM_.mp3",
          "teaching_start_point": "0215",
          "teaching_end_point": "0223"
        },
        {
          "book_name": "Haggai",
          "book_id": "Haggai",
          "book_order": "",
          "chapter_id": "2",
          "chapter_title": "Chapter 2",
          "verse_id": "17",
          "verse_text": "Бив Я вас посухою й зеленячкою та градом, усі чини ваших рук, та не кликали ви до Мене, говорить Господь.",
          "paragraph_number": "17",
          "teaching_id": "18881",
          "teaching_audio": "https://ttb-transcoder-final-prod.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/741bb091-2d27-475a-aed3-96bec4487b0d",
          "teaching_name": "Аггея 2:15-23",
          "teachings_badge_image": "https://manage.churchbase.com/uploads/ttb_bible_badges/Haggai.jpg",
